></name><name><surname>de Jonge</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosendaal</surname><given-names>FR</given-names></name><name><surname>Schultz</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoekstra</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Predisposing factors for hypoglycemia in the intensive care unit</article-title><source>Crit Care Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>96</fpage><lpage>101</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16374162</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.CCM.0000194536.89694.06</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reinhart</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunkhorst</surname><given-names>FM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bone</surname><given-names>HG</given-names></name><name><surname>Gerlach</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Grundling</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kreymann</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kujath</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Marggraf</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Mayer</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Meier-Hellmann</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Peckelsen</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Putensen</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Quintel</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ragaller</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rossaint</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>St&#x000fc;ber</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Weiler</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Welte</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Werdan</surname><given-names>K</given-names></